    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d725-a1">

                <pb facs="0865" n="771" xml:id="pg771"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 2543.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Teodoro Perez &amp; Co. to Mr.
                    Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >West Tampa, Fla.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-25"><hi rendition="#italic">July 25,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: We beg to inclose you draft on New
                    York for the amount of $150, which we beg of you to cash and deliver the amount
                    to Mr. Julio Sanguily, the American citizen now in prison in Habana.</p>
                <p>We beg of you, too, to deliver him the inclosed letter.</p>
                <p>With respect, remain yours,</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Teodoro Perez</hi> &amp; Co.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
